  {
   "id": "8doors-arum-s-afterlife-adventure-137635@post-2021-04-27",
   "gameId": "8doors-arum-s-afterlife-adventure-137635",
   "displayName": "Patch Notes #2",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2021-04-27T08:20:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Greetings, fellow travelers of purgatory!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re here with the most recent patch notes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added Cloud Save",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now use Cloud Save to save your progress on Steam.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Please note that you will have to manually select Cloud Save for it to work, the save is not automatic.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added guardian pets",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve added cute little guardian pets!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Remember the really big specter that chased you around? Well it’s a lot smaller now!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thurible",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can now upgrade your thurible to store more fugitive souls.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The upgrade can be bought from Deller.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’ve also made bug fixes, balance changes and some localization polish work as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are additional updates on the way, and we’re excited to roll them out in the future.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Just to give you guys an idea of what the update is going to be, it’s going to things like a new Journal to keep track of different specters and a new Boss Rush challenge mode.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have any questions about the game, consider hopping on our Discord server for help from the community and us!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord: https://discord.gg/94qFECw",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Email : 8doors_support@neowiz.com",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
