  {
   "id": "8doors-arum-s-afterlife-adventure-137635@post-2021-04-16",
   "gameId": "8doors-arum-s-afterlife-adventure-137635",
   "displayName": "Patch Notes #2 & Announcement",
   "kind": "hotfix",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2021-04-16T10:17:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello Afterlife Adventurers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "This update aims to address some of the things we saw in your feedback. Thank you so much for letting us know what you think about the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Cloud Save]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We implemented a pre-update to turn the Steam Cloud Save feature back on",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Please let us know if your save file doesn’t load up properly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[UI Improvement]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We added a feature to the UI that will make it easier to swap weapons (pictured below)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Show the location of mirror shards picked up by the player.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[Bug Fixes]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a problem where boss events wouldn’t work properly after turning off the game during one of them",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bug which player can’t land on spinning wheel when they are in Ducroak form.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bug where the prices would mistakenly revert back to normal after resetting your skills because the number of times skills were reset wasn’t being saved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed bug where the player had 4 potions but the HUD incorrectly displayed them having 5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also made several other fixes and adjustments based on your feedback/reports.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If for some reason the game isn’t starting or running properly, please follow the directions below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Find the save file at the location listed below.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "C:\\Users\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Rootless\\8Doors",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Zip the folder and send it to 8doors_support@neowiz.com so that we can analyze.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You’ll see us again soon with more improvements to the game, but please feel free to reach out to us anytime through Discord or email.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Discord : https://discord.gg/94qFECw",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Email : 8doors_support@neowiz.com",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
